
` THE ATLAS. most of the small pictures of the game are rectangles of one picture, Fish/Textures/Atlas,
` and not files of their own. this says where each one is, by the path that it used to be loaded from, so
` the code that loads it by that path does not change. see `atlas region`.
`
` the atlas is made from art-sheet/temp_art.pdn, the layered Paint.NET sheet of the art: every cell takes
` the topmost layer that has something in it. this file and the atlas are made together, by
` `pdnsheet atlas` in build/pdnsheet. do not change this file by hand; change the sheet and make them again.
` the pictures that the board draws with FishEffect (the quest pieces, the bones, the ghost and the
` bottle) are not in it, because that effect would see the whole atlas. fish.fbasic comes here first.
load_atlas:
    global TEX_ATLAS
    texture free texture id(TEX_ATLAS), "Fish/Textures/Atlas"
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bird_feast", 16, 38, 48, 48 `01, from 'Current art'
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bomb", 80, 38, 48, 48 `02, from 'Current art'
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bottles", 144, 38, 48, 48 `03, from 'Current art'
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bottom_feeder", 208, 38, 48, 48 `04, from 'Current art'
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bottoms_up", 272, 38, 48, 48 `05, from 'Current art'
    atlas region TEX_ATLAS, "Fish/Textures/Cards/bright_idea", 336, 38, 48, 48 `06, from 'Current art'
